              <tr class="bg-white border-t border-gray-200"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#1A1F22]">Gear selector not in Park</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Key won't turn or release</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Reseat the shifter, press the brake</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Rarely</td></tr>
