        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We're open Sunday through Thursday 7AM to 10PM and Friday 7AM to 3:45PM. Saturday we're closed, and emergency service is available by appointment. Dover drivers can start at our <a href="/service-areas/dover-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline">Dover service page</a>, and if you're also locked out of the car, read <a href="/blog/what-to-do-when-locked-out-of-car/" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline">what to do when you're locked out of your car</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Check out whoever you call first. The Federal Trade Commission has long urged people to <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/node/43494" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">"do the research before you need a locksmith"</a>, and our guide on <a href="/blog/how-to-avoid-locksmith-scams/" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline">how to avoid locksmith scams</a> lists what to watch for.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Ready when you are. Call (302) 735-0050 or <a href="/contact/" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline">request a visit</a>. Tell us the make, model and year, and what the key does when you try it. We'll explain the job before we begin.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 mt-10">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Sources</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
            <li><a href="https://repairpal.com/symptoms/car-key-wont-turn" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RepairPal, What To Do If Your Ignition Key Won't Turn, March 30, 2017</a></li>
